### =====================================================================
### Lab06 – A04 Cryptographic Failures (CWE-916, CWE-327, CWE-321, CWE-329)
### Upute: docs/labs/lab06-crypto.md
### =====================================================================
@host = http://localhost:5080

### ---------------- Dio A: lozinke ----------------

### 1) "Procurjela" baza lozinki – pogledajte hasheve (ranjivo: 32 heks znaka = MD5; ivan i maja isti!)
GET {{host}}/api/lab06/customers/export

### 2) Registracija novog kupca
POST {{host}}/api/lab06/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "novi.kupac", "password": "123456"}

### 3) Prijava točnom lozinkom – 200
POST {{host}}/api/lab06/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "novi.kupac", "password": "123456"}

### 4) Prijava krivom lozinkom – 401
POST {{host}}/api/lab06/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "novi.kupac", "password": "kriva"}

### 5) Ponovno export: novi.kupac ima ISTI hash kao ivan i maja (ranjivo) → razbijanje jednog = razbijanje svih
GET {{host}}/api/lab06/customers/export

### ---------------- Dio B: kartice ----------------

### 6) Spremi karticu
POST {{host}}/api/lab06/cards
Content-Type: application/json

{"cardNumber": "4111111111111111"}

### 7) Spremi ISTI broj još jednom
POST {{host}}/api/lab06/cards
Content-Type: application/json

{"cardNumber": "4111111111111111"}

### 8) NAPAD: usporedite šifrate – ranjivo: identični (ECB, bez IV-a)
GET {{host}}/api/lab06/cards

### 9) Maskirani prikaz kartice (id iz koraka 6)
GET {{host}}/api/lab06/cards/1/masked

### 10) PROVJERA POPRAVKA: ponovite 1), 6), 7), 8) – hashevi u obliku pbkdf2-sha256$600000$...,
###     različiti za istu lozinku; šifrati različiti i dulji (nonce + tag)
GET {{host}}/api/lab06/customers/export
